max_published_version() to query highest non-yanked crates.io version\n- Output max_published_version from check-release-needed for downstream use\n- Support pre-release versions (e.g., 0.1.0-beta.1) in version parsing\n- Add --release-label parameter for multi-language release disambiguation\n- Make publish-crate.rs fail (exit 1) when version already exists on crates.io\n- Improve create-github-release.rs to check combined stdout+stderr and Validation Failed\n- Add version fallback logic in auto-release Create GitHub Release step\n- Add destination_dir and keep_files for multi-language GitHub Pages doc coexistence\n- Add Codecov badge to README.md\n- Include case study analysis with comparison report\n\nFixes #26\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"81068843d3986f872796142eec45df337269fc2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/git/trees/81068843d3986f872796142eec45df337269fc2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/git/commits/d4f423949a6602f4b4fbc8ca98931691a8322055","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commits/d4f423949a6602f4b4fbc8ca98931691a8322055","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commit/d4f423949a6602f4b4fbc8ca98931691a8322055","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commits/d4f423949a6602f4b4fbc8ca98931691a8322055/comments","author":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/u