nard@gmail.com","date":"2026-04-13T06:51:48Z"},"message":"fix: check crates.io instead of git tags in version-and-commit.rs\n\nReplace check_tag_exists() (which used git rev-parse) with\ncheck_version_on_crates_io() that queries the crates.io API. Git tags\nare not the correct source of truth for whether a Rust package version\nhas been published — tags can exist without the package being on\ncrates.io (e.g., failed publish, GitHub-only releases).\n\nThis aligns version-and-commit.rs with check-release-needed.rs which\nalready correctly uses crates.io as the authoritative source.\n\nFixes #25\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69ddd7236e499a6158de71a8eaa14e24c8a4a11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/git/trees/69ddd7236e499a6158de71a8eaa14e24c8a4a11a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/git/commits/6c85121448b7cce4d3ea7b9787317081386a2d9c","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commits/6c85121448b7cce4d3ea7b9787317081386a2d9c","html_url":"https://github.com/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commit/6c85121448b7cce4d3ea7b9787317081386a2d9c","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-foundation/rust-ai-driven-development-pipeline-template/commits/6c85121448b7cce4d3ea7b9787317081386a2d9c/comments","author":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api